e-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/SEO_json.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>SEO Specialist Bootcamp<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (6983)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul class=\"course-meta\">\n                                <li>\ud83d\udc64 18000 Learners<\/li>\n                                <li>\u23f1 6 Weeks<\/li>\n                            <\/ul>\n\n                            <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                       target=\"_blank\"\n                                       class=\"btn view-btn btn-sm\">\n                                        View Brochure\n                                    <\/a>\n                                \n                                <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SEO Career Paths<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>There are no straightforward career opportunities in SEO, and the trajectory depends on the following:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Size and growth of the company\/team<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Type of company<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Since SEOs are involved in many projects, they can transition into entirely different roles outside of SEO. Depending on the work they are involved in, these roles may include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. SEO Apprentice<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>These are entry-level SEO jobs for beginners in the industry. Apprentices are college graduates with basic knowledge of SEO looking to grow in the industry.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>SEO apprentice responsibilities include:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Knowledge of basic SEO principles&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fix broken links&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Evaluate data in Google Analytics and Google Search Console<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Familiarity with keyword research tools<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Implement inbound link-building strategies&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO apprentice jobs require limited skills, education, and minimal experience because this job aims to get experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">&nbsp;2. Junior SEO Specialist<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO analysts and specialists are junior titles. They create and evaluate SEO campaigns and collaborate with other marketing teams for optimal results. The core skills include strategic and analytical thinking, as they are required to create and review campaigns to boost sales.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The responsibilities of an SEO analyst and specialist include the following:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perform keyword research<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Set goals for campaigns and keyword strategies&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Analyze website content&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Track web performance&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Collaborate with other SEO experts and stakeholders<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Create SEO-optimized content<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">&nbsp;3. Senior SEO Specialist<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Senior SEO specialists take on leadership roles in the industry, overseeing entry-level and junior SEO job activities and taking on seniority and managerial functions to supervise and monitor junior SEO specialist roles.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Senior SEO Specialist jobs demand the following skills:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Advanced knowledge of organic search&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Practical communication skills with team members<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO audit skills<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>On-page strategies execution<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Website visitor analytics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Strategic planning&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. SEO Manager<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>An SEO manager drives traffic and awareness for companies, delegates technical tasks, supervises various team leads, manages team members&#8217; productivity, and coaches them.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As an SEO manager, you do more managerial work, including managing large-scale SEO marketing projects and overseeing projects&#8217; progress from start to end.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You must have a broad skill set to handle several obligations like data analytics and strategies. As an SEO manager, you may have to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Manage projects&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Manage brands&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Analyse data<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Create and manage online communities&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Organize clients&#8217; meetings<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Conduct market analysis&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. SEO Head<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>With years of experience and honing expertise, you can have a career as the SEO Head, also known as SEO Director. They focus on strategy, planning, and management and supervise other jobs and teams managed by SEO managers. Collaboration, innovation, team management, and analytical skills are core requirements for SEO director jobs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Generally, at least seven years of experience is necessary in designing and executing SEO strategies. Director SEO careers are result-driven, so it&#8217;s vital to know how to evaluate numerous metrics for project development.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>As an SEO director, you are expected to:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Strategies formulation<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Set quarterly and yearly performance goals&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Work closely with content and marketing teams&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Oversee on and off-site SEO strategies and implementation&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Collaborate with HR to identify departmental gaps<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Conduct data analytics and proficiency&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Identify new opportunities for a competitive edge<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.c