ecoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SEO Profile Description<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The following provides an overview of the role of SEO and what you can expect in this career field:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>An SEO specialist is a marketing expert who uses research and analysis to rank a website on search engines, especially Google, to get more traffic to a site from search engines.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>An SEO professional must understand <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/search-engine-functions\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">how search engines work<\/a> to tailor strategies accordingly. Search engines send out search engine spiders or crawlers to discover web pages. They crawl and evaluate a page to see if it can be added to that search engine\u2019s index, a collection of web pages showing users when searching via keywords.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When someone enters a search term, Google returns the relevant indexed pages for that search term, i.e., keyword. Many factors and variables play a part in search engine algorithms. Search engines use these to deliver high-quality, relevant results to users on searching.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Since many ranking factors there are, an SEO expert has to learn many things. They have to optimize a site to comply with search engine best practices. As a result, specialists need to understand the broad components of digital marketing.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Given below are some of the skills you need as an expert in SEO:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Technical Skills<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Non-technical Skills<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Knowledge of Digital Marketing and SEO<\/td><td>Analytical skills<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Dynamic leading ability<\/td><td>Critical thinking<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Ability to resolve crawling issues<\/td><td>Research skills<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Keyword research<\/td><td>Communication skills<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Basics of HTML and CSS<\/td><td>Problem-solving<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Google algorithms, Copywriting, and Visual content<\/td><td>Adaptability &amp; Collaboration<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SEO Roles and Responsibilities<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>An SEO expert must be responsible to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Gather and analyze SEO trends and customer behavior<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Distribute content on social media<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Research and implement relevant keywords&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Develop high-quality backlinks&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monitor and report analytics of a website and search engine marketing campaigns&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adopt user experience and conversion rate optimization practices&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Study and understand the SEO strategy of the competitors&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Optimize the content of the website for SEM<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Give recommendations to developers on search terms, rankings, and analytics&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Run pay-per-click (PPC) campaigns&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Engage with other businesses on link-building<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Develop and implement effective content strategies&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/local-seo-ranking-factors\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Top 8 Local SEO Ranking Factors For Fast Growth<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SEO Job Profiles and Designations<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Trainee or a junior SEO executive. Practice and learn advanced SEO techniques and upgrade your skills. You can then move towards SEO executive, Sr. Executive, Manager, or team leader. You can also become a specialist in building backlinks or writing content. You can upgrade your skills and improve in analytics, PPC, etc.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can also learn Google Analytics and Google Adwords and become a Google-certified professional to upgrade your career and earnings.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO experts have several opportunities to choose from. Some of the SEO job titles that professionals with this <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/digital-marketing-skills\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing skill<\/a> set can apply for are:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>SEO Trainee<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Jr. SEO Executive<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sr. SEO Executive<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Analyst<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Link Building Expert<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Consultant<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Project Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO and SEM Specialist<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Adwords Specialist \/ PPC Expert<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Analytics Expert<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Digital Marketing Manager<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SEO Trainer<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Freelance SEO consultant<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3568cff12edd1091b5a414a41fd6a290\"><strong>Essential SEO Topics You Should Know<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/backli