ines, SEO could typically be achieved by spammy activities such as black hat link building, keyword stuffing, etc.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>SEO has evolved as a profession as search engines have become savvier about delivering quality, relevant content to searchers. Being an SEO is a matter of developing the best web content for your audience. SEO requires diverse technical, strategic, creative, and analytical skills beyond just getting a site to rank.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The digital marketing and SEO career future opportunities are accelerating as the demand grows. As businesses move online and a brand\u2019s digital presence becomes essential, the need for companies to be found by their users will always be at the forefront of their business strategy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There is no better time to get into digital marketing and SEO than now. And with multiple career paths leading toward success, it\u2019s a worthwhile journey that appears to pay off now and well into the future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SEO Job Salary 2026<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Two ways to get paid as an SEO expert and earn an <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-salary-india\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO salary<\/a> are:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>You get paid salaries monthly if you work with an agency or in-house. Also, as a freelancer, you can work out a salary-based payment structure with your clients. SEO career salaries provide a consistent flow of income, giving you a sense of security.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hourly<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Hourly rates are most common among freelancers. However, you can request hourly pay from the employer if you work in an agency or company. The benefit of this is that working overtime or during holidays doubles your income. You must stand out among other employees to attract these incentives and negotiate your worth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also read: <\/stro